]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko_speak Yeah!"]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko_speak I first saw Prophetbot standing alone in the snow, and I thought he was abandoned there."]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko_speak But then I found Silver, and she told me that he wasn't abandoned, he's just hard to tame!"]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko_speak She said that he didn't respond to my appearance, or robots that looked and acted like me, but the last one wasn't so good, so she was waiting for a new one."]},{"code":101,"params":["@kip2 Yeah, I don't know how that last one got past QA..."]},{"code":101,"params":["@kip_pout It was embarrassingly bad."]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko_pancakes BUT THEN...!"]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko_speak I remembered that he DID respond to me when I talked with him!"]},{"code":101,"params":["@kip_worry He did!?"]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko_pancakes Yeah!"]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko_speak But only when I was holding a small lightbulb!"]},{"code":101,"params":["@kip2 The sun? He recognizes the messiah by the sun?"]},{"code":101,"params":["@kip_sigh That seems so obvious in hindsight..."]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko_speak Silver said that too, but turns out it's not just the sun!"]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko_smile You just need the sun AND my appearance!"]},{"code":101,"params":["@kip2 Huh, interesting."]},{"code":101,"params":["@kip I'll be sure to ask Silver about it then."]},{"code":101,"params":["@george6_shrug Sure, just talk about something I've no clue about."]},{"code":101,"params":["@kip_huh Oh, I didn't tell you?"]},{"code":101,"params":["@george6 I dunno, have you?"]},{"code":101,"params":["@george6_shrug I've been mighty forgetful lately."]},{"code":101,"params":["@kip I'll fill you in on the details later."]},{"code":101,"params":["@kip So,\\. I'm guessing Silver got a gift as well?"]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko_smile Of course! It was a-"]},{"code":101,"params":["@kip Don't just tell me!"]},{"code":101,"params":["@kip_wink I'd like to find out for myself."]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko_83c Hehe, okay!"]}]}]},{"id":65,"name":"why are you here","x":29,"y":47,"pages":[{"list":[{"code":101,"params":["@niko_speak Why are you two here at this time?"]},{"code":101,"params":["@george6 I'm chillin' with my good ol' friend Kip, who decided to crawl out of the lab once in never."]},{"code":101,"params":["@kip_heh You make it sound like I'm a troglodyte."]},{"code":101,"params":["@george6_shrug Might as well be..."]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko What's that?"]},{"code":101,"params":["@kip Basically, someone who never leaves the cave they live in."]},{"code":101,"params":["@george6 Exhibit A, right over here."]},{"code":101,"params":["@kip_heh I'm working on it!"]},{"code":101,"params":["@kip_wink I AM out here now, aren't I?"]},{"code":101,"params":["@kip_heh Even if it's just to monitor the robots."]},{"code":101,"params":["@kip_wink Normally I'd do it from the lab, but I thought it's time I start leaving my little cave more often."]},{"code":101,"params":["@kip And speaking of bad habits..."]},{"code":101,"params":["@kip_wink How about fixing that sleep schedule, George?"]},{"code":101,"params":["@george6_point Same as you, working on it right now."]},{"code":101,"params":["@george6_smile Dude, don't tell me you thought I'd get up this early to freeze my assets off."]},{"code":101,"params":["@kip_wink Nope, just pointing it out."]},{"code":101,"params":["@george6_point Man, you're lucky there's a kid here restricting my vocabulary."]},{"code":101,"params":["@kip_wink Write it down for later, before you crash."]}]}]},{"id":66,"name":"whats happening here","x":30,"y":47,"pages":[{"list":[{"code":101,"params":["@niko_speak What's going on here?"]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko The place looks different, and I see a lot of robots down there."]},{"code":101,"params":["@george6_fingerguns Upgrades, kid!"]},{"code":101,"params":["@george6 This place called \"outside\" ain't so bad anymore, and the city's making it even nicer so people leave their holes more often."]},{"code":101,"params":["@george6 Some trees here, some benches there, and you got yourself a nice hang out spot."]},{"code":101,"params":["@george6_point \\p knows, some people could go out and do a little moss touching."]},{"code":101,"params":["@kip And who might those people be, I wonder?"]},{"code":101,"params":["@george6_shrug Oh, no one in particular, just some people who's name starts with \"K\" and ends with \"ip Silverpoint\"..."]},{"code":101,"params":["@kip_wink Lots of glass in that house of yours. \\>\\nI'll be sure to get you a sample too."]},{"code":101,"params":["@george6_smile Sweet!"]},{"code":101,"params":["@kip But yeah, we're just about done with repairs, and are now expanding what we can."]},{"code":101,"params":["@kip_wink Lots of room now that we don't need all these phosphor pools."]},{"code":101,"params":["@kip Refuge's also going to get a lot greener, now that plants can grows outside."]},{"code":101,"params":["@kip I've heard there's this one gardener who's been tirelessly preparing for the spring."]},{"code":111,"params":[0,414,0]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"params":["@niko_speak Oh, you mean Mason?"]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"params":["@niko_speak He has a plant pot for a head!"]},{"code":411},{"code":101,"indent":1,"params":["@niko_speak Oh, was it someone with a plant pot for a head?"]},{"code":101,"params":["@kip_pout Don't know, we haven't met yet."]},{"code":101,"params":["@kip2 I've only heard he has big plans to \"turn the Refuge green\" a few days ago."]},{"code":101,"params":["@kip Which is why we have a meeting scheduled to hear his plans."]},{"code":101,"params":["@kip Is he a friend of yours?"]},{"code":111,"params":[0,414,0]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"params":["@niko_pancakes Yeah!"]},{"code":111,"indent":1,"params":[0,386,0]},{"code":101,"indent":2,"params":["@niko_speak And he told me about the plans!"]},{"code":101,"indent":2,"params":["@kip Oh? I'll keep that name in mind then!"]},{"code":101,"indent":2,"params":["@niko5 But can I\\..\\..\\..\\@niko2 ask you to move the meeting closer, please?"]},{"code":101,"indent":2,"params":["@niko He said he can't sleep because it's stressing him so much."]},{"code":101,"indent":2,"params":["@kip_heh Sadly it's not entirely up to me..."]},{"code":101,"indent":2,"params":["@kip But I'll see what I can do."]},{"code":101,"indent":2,"params":["@kip Just don't tell him I said this, he'll be notified if it gets moved."]},{"code":101,"indent":2,"params":["@niko_speak Thank you!"]},{"code":101,"indent":2,"params":["@george6_smile I wish I had a messiah to reschedule meetings for me!"]},{"code":101,"indent":2,"params":["@kip_wink And by \"reschedule\" you mean \"cancel\", right?"]},{"code":101,"indent":2,"params":["@george6_shrug You know me too well."]},{"code":411,"indent":1},{"code":101,"indent":2,"params":["@niko_think But he didn't say anything about any plan..."]},{"code":101,"indent":2,"params":["@kip Maybe it wasn't him, afterall."]},{"code":101,"indent":2,"params":["@kip I've heard a lot of people started getting into gardening, wouldn't be surprised if some of them have some ambitious plans."]},{"code":411},{"code":101,"indent":1,"params":["@niko_eyeclosed Yeah, but I don't know his name either..."]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"params":["@kip_pout Huh, alright."]},{"code":111,"params":[0,433,1]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"params":["@george6_point Oh kid, by the way, there's a little something closer to the library you might like."]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"params":["@kip Oh right, the-"]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"params":["@george6_point Don't spoil it."]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"params":["@kip_heh Fine."]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"params":["@niko_speak What is it?"]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"params":["@george6_fingerguns That is for you to find out!"]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"params":["@niko_83c Okay!"]}]}]},{"id":67,"name":"just saying hi","x":31,"y":47,"pages":[{"list":[{"code":101,"p